  "description": "Kim Doha is a notorious womanizer, known for sleeping around with just about any woman. One day, a check is suddenly thrust in front of him. “What?” “I want to buy a night with you. How much?\" The woman boldly offering to pay for a night with him looks, by all appearances, like a well-behaved young lady from a wealthy family. But Doha has never been one to turn down a woman, so he readily accepts her offer... ‘Wait, did I seriously just fall for her because of that? Nah, no way.’ But there's something about this woman... She's exactly Kim Doha's type!\nSource: MU",
